    Internal Revenue Code resulting, for example, from relationship
    between a hotel management company and any of our stockholders
    could impact such hotel management company&#146;s ability to
    satisfy the applicable ownership limits. Discovery of any such
    relationship could disqualify such hotel management company as
    and &#147;eligible independent contractor,&#148; which could in
    turn cause us to fail to qualify as a REIT. If we fail to
    qualify for or lose our status as a REIT, we would be subject to
