</DIV>

<DIV style="margin-top: 6pt; font-size: 1pt">&nbsp;</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="margin-left: 0%; margin-right: 0%; text-indent: 4%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times; color: #000000; background: #FFFFFF">
    To the extent we determine to accept share redemption requests
    from our stockholders, redemption of shares of our common stock
    will be made quarterly upon written request to us at least
    15&#160;days prior to the end of the applicable quarter.
    Redemption requests will be honored approximately 30&#160;days
    following the end of the
