    1.&#160;<I><U>Distribution Reinvestment</U>.</I>&#160;&#160;As
    agent for the stockholders (&#147;Stockholders&#148;) of the
    Company who (i)&#160;purchase shares of the Company&#146;s
    common stock (&#147;Shares&#148;) pursuant to the Company&#146;s
